msgstr ""

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_om_pos_access_hr
msgid ""
"The Point of Sale restrictions of POS Access Control, for the employees who "
"log in to the shop with a badge or a PIN"
msgstr ""

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_refund
msgid ""
"The Refund button of the Point of Sale is hidden, and refunds sent anyway "
"are refused."
msgstr ""

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_discount
msgid ""
"The discount key (%) of the Point of Sale is disabled, and orders sent with "
"a discounted line, or with the global discount, are refused. Refunding a "
"discounted sale stays possible."
msgstr ""

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_max_refund
msgid ""
"The highest amount, taxes included, an order may give back, in the currency "
"of the shop. 0 for no limit."
msgstr ""

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_max_discount
msgid "The highest discount that may be given on a line. 0 for no limit."
msgstr ""

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_price_change
msgid ""
"The price key of the Point of Sale is disabled, and a price below the one of"
" the pricelist is refused."
msgstr ""

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_pos_access_hr.hr_employee_view_form_pos_access
msgid ""
"What this employee may not do in the Point of Sale, when they log in to the shop with their\n"
"                        badge or PIN."
msgstr ""

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_own_rules
msgid ""
"When this employee is the cashier, the rules below apply. Off, they follow "
"the rules of their Odoo user, or else of the Odoo user who opened the shop."
msgstr ""
